    "description": "<p>You channel pure aether through your body, re-energizing you, and enabling you to move more quickly.</p><p>You regain <strong>1 Stamina</strong> at the start of your next turn. Until then, your <strong>Stride</strong> speed increases by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1</strong> <strong>rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the <strong>Stamina</strong> healed by +<strong>1</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You may also increase the bonus to your <strong>Stride</strong> speed by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.Q3wpy3R1g3EPjwPc]{Aether Attunement}</p>",
